# Writing a reply: the Compose overlay, the on-screen keyboard, and the toast the send leaves
# behind. `message out` stands in for the radio's echo - the store only raises the SEND action,
# and there is no app or radio behind this harness to carry it out.
scene demo
scale 4
delay 130

hold 500
key down 4
key a
hold 700
key y
hold 700
key up
key a
hold 500
key down
key right 8
key a
hold 400
key down
key left
key a
hold 700
key start
message out BRVO ok
toast Sent to BRVO
hold 1500
